      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "option 1:\n\nclient commits data to his own device. just raw, encrypted storage.\nfvm pulls data, runs incremental backup on it and redistributes to other devices / storage providers.\n\nquestions:\n- how to setup devices to store on their own, filecoin commited storage\n- can fvm do this? run computations on data?\n\nwe can offer a smart contract that takes a small fee and runs this fvm service.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "option 1:\n\nclient commits data to his own device. just raw, encrypted storage.\nfvm pulls data, runs incremental backup on it and redistributes to other devices / storage providers.\n\nquestions:\n- how to setup devices to store on their own, filecoin commited storage\n- can fvm do this? run computations on data?\n\nwe can offer a smart contract that takes a small fee and runs this fvm service.",
